  "question": {
    "text": "A Wheatstone bridge has the resistances $10 \\Omega$. $10 \\Omega, 10 \\Omega$ and $30 \\Omega$ in its four arms. What resistance joined in parallel to the $30 \\Omega$ resistance will bring it to the balanced condition?"
