  "solution": {
    "text": "In balanced Wheatstone bridge,\r\n$$\r\n\\begin{array}{l}\r\n\\frac{1}{10}=\\frac{1}{x}+\\frac{1}{30} \\\\\r\nx=15 \\Omega\r\n\\end{array}\r\n$$"
